      en: ["The San Pedro Apóstol Church is an official National Monument.", "In 1770, the reported population was approximately 585 inhabitants.", "The Jiboa River flows through the municipal territory of Masahuat.", "Main patronal festivals are held from June 24th to June 29th.", "The town is located at an average elevation of 210 meters.", "San Pedro Masahuat belongs to the historical Nonualcos region."],
